  "pet_notes": "Kusanagi Nene from Project SEKAI, initial Kamiyama high school uniform, one-star Foul-Mouthed and Unsociable card. Long muted sage-grey green hair past waist, thick asymmetrical sweeping bangs and two low-tied sidelocks held by small dark rose bands; violet eyes. Navy blazer with thin white piping around lapels and pockets, two brass buttons; white shirt; red diagonal white striped bow ribbon; blue grey plaid pleated skirt; dark grey short calf socks and brown school loafers. No props. Quiet mildly deadpan shy girl, restrained expressions, tiny hesitant wave, focused chin-hand thinking, modest happy small jump. Preserve outfit and face across all frames.",
